**Describe the bug**
I am trying to create an F# IEnumerable from predictions. The code works in .NET Interactive notebooks, but it does not work in Visual Studio 2022 17.3.2 via F# interactive. I have also tried pasting the code into F# interactive by running `dotnet fsi` at the command line, but I get the same error.

